      <h1 class="jr-h1">How Long Does Collagen Take to Work? A Week-by-Week Timeline</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">Almost every brand answers this with "results in two weeks", and no trial supports that. Here is the timeline the studies actually measured, outcome by outcome, including the ones where the wait is six months and the one where the evidence never arrived.</p>

